            "review_title": "Review at Smile Cafe, Bar, Shisha",
            "review_text": "SydneyTeviot\nSydney514 contributions\n0\nThey have no idea about acceptable service\nMay 2016 • Couples\nDropped by for a beer and a rest after a big day of walking around Hanoi.\n\nThe only beer they sell is Budweiser. They brought my husband a room temperature bottle and a tall glass of ice! It was undrinkable, so we asked for the bill and left. 40000 VND and not a question about what was the problem. As soon as we had gone the two guys running the places sat down and waited for the next hapless customer.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 16, 2016",
